The sentence describes a person maintaining a position/viewpoint about dividing assets. The key verb phrase indicating the event is **"giữ nguyên quan điểm"** (maintains/keeps his viewpoint).

This is a "Maintain-position" type of event, which corresponds to **"End-position"** in the valid event types provided (indicating continuation/maintenance of a position).

